### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
@aiUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/ai

### 1. Create a New Task (Full Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Hackathon Backend",
  "description": "Implement Task entity, repository, service, and controller endpoints",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-25"
}

### 2. Create Another Task (Minimal - Default status PENDING)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Setup PostgreSQL Database",
  "description": "Migrate from H2 to PostgreSQL for production storage"
}

### 3. Retrieve All Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Retrieve Task by ID (Existing Task)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Retrieve Task by ID (Non-existent Task - Tests 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/999
Accept: application/json

### 6. Update Task by ID (Existing Task)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Hackathon Backend (Finished!)",
  "description": "CRUD operations, H2 database, and test cases implemented successfully",
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-20"
}

### 7. Update Task by ID (Non-existent Task - Tests 404 Not Found)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost Task",
  "description": "This task does not exist",
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### 8. Delete Task by ID (Existing Task - Expects 204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/2

### 9. Delete Task by ID (Non-existent Task - Tests 404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/999

### 10. Verify Deletion of Task 2 (Expects 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/2
Accept: application/json

### 11. AI Subtask Suggestions (Google Gemini gemini-3.8-flash)
POST {{aiUrl}}/suggest-subtasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskDescription": "Organize a 24-hour university hackathon for 150 students"
}
